{"html":"<h1 id=\"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic\">Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic</h1>\n<p>Workload: <code>spectral-norm-small</code>. Three warmups and ten measured runs per cell.</p>\n<p>Environment: GitHub <code>macos15</code> image <code>20260829.0321.1</code>; macOS 15.7.9 (Darwin 24.6.0); arm64 Apple M1 (Virtual). Chrome 152.0.7977.65 with ChromeDriver/WebDriver 152.0.7977.64, Firefox 154.0.1 with geckodriver 0.37.1, and Safari 26.6.1.</p>\n<p>This early run did not capture a same-host native VKF baseline, so it is not presented as a language-performance comparison. The raw JSON retains all diagnostic artifact cells.</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Scrollable table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">VKF WebAssembly runtime</th><th scope=\"col\">Mean ± sample SD</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Chrome (V8)</td><td>69.880 ± 48.378 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Firefox (SpiderMonkey)</td><td>48.400 ± 8.113 ms</td></tr><tr><td>Safari (JavaScriptCore)</td><td>48.400 ± 4.402 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Compile, cold instantiate+execute, warm-kernel <a href=\"../sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json\">raw samples and CI95</a> are retained with artifact and compiler hashes. See the <a href=\"https://github.com/svenviktorjonsson/vektor-flow/actions/runs/34196797747\">successful source workflow run</a>. No aggregate score or release-performance claim is made.</p>","headings":[{"level":1,"title":"Historical VKF WebAssembly browser diagnostic","id":"historical-vkf-webassembly-browser-diagnostic"}],"examples":[],"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.md","route":"benchmarks/browser-0.4.3.html","releaseCatalog":{"schema":"vektor-flow/release-catalog-v1","latest":"0.4.7","latestBrowserRuntime":{"version":"0.4.7","url":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=45bd29853b0c4cbafca525718861c337d3a1c223bf616584d388754a3ff3db6e"},"releases":[{"version":"0.4.7","tag":"v0.4.7","status":"published","browserRuntimeWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/runtimes/v0.4.7/vkf-shared-compiler.wasm?sha256=45bd29853b0c4cbafca525718861c337d3a1c223bf616584d388754a3ff3db6e","benchmarkTier":"patch","benchmark":{"summary":"Local Windows, Linux, and Firefox comparisons; unmeasured cells remain explicit.","browser":null,"evidenceUrl":"https://vektorflow.org/performance.html"},"downloads":{"windows":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64-setup.exe?sha256=6963e57967a25f4547b32656778fdb4c96161fc6953f131540ccf038973d44e0","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-windows-x64.zip?sha256=af01622b39835dfbbed395186c7c258bfb3182af81f0f98fdf771e327cec912d"},"linux":{"installer":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.deb?sha256=b02018736aecb49829c8ec88ebc340cbf14ea86b722c1b6ca0d980aa26838b0a","archive":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-linux-x64.tar.gz?sha256=b95a1f24aca44526171b3a0f48baff7c19a4644e3365b2cf7656b5faf6f59430"},"macos":{"installer":null,"archive":null},"browserWasm":"https://vektorflow.org/downloads/v0.4.7/vektor-flow-browser-wasm.zip?sha256=57c6ccf888a2df1c7bf70240c28d94d0800bd48e496901eeab0c8705ba09799a"}}]},"dependencies":[],"assets":[{"source":"benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json","output":"sources/benchmarks/core-comparison/results/macos-arm64-wasm-provisional-10.json"}]}
